{"availability":"available","full":"Diosvely/MiniERP","name":"MiniERP","description":"Mini ERP de contabilidad general española (PGC, IVA, IGIC) · React + PostgreSQL/Supabase · inspirado en Business Central y SAP FI","category":"Business","language":"PLpgSQL","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-29T14:29:34Z","updated":"2026-10-10T18:48:32Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://minierp-6ty.pages.dev","topics":[],"demo":"https://minierp-6ty.pages.dev/?demo","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T19:03:59.532Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T19:03:59.532Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T19:03:59.532Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T19:03:59.532Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["🔗 Demo en vivo: minierp-6ty.pages.dev/?demo · Entra como invitado, sin registrarte, y consulta las empresas de ejemplo. O regístrate, crea tu empresa y contabiliza.","ERP web de contabilidad general para aprender contabilidad española (PGC 2007, IVA e IGIC) como lo haría una gestoría: asientos, terceros, registro de facturas, liquidación trimestral e informes de auditor. La estructura de datos se inspira en Microsoft Dynamics 365 Business Central y SAP FI, y el registro de facturas en los ERP españoles (A3, Sage, ContaPlus), simplificado para que cada pieza se entienda. Proyecto de aprendizaje en evolución.","English summary. A web-based general ledger (mini ERP) built to learn Spanish accounting (Spanish GAAP – PGC 2007, VAT and Canary Islands IGIC): business partners, invoice registration with automatic VAT/IGIC, quarterly tax settlement (forms 303 / 420), trial balance, general ledger and unusual-balance audit report. Data model inspired by Business Central and SAP FI. Database in English, bilingual UI (Spanish / English), multi-company, multi-user, guest access to demo companies, accounting rules enforced by PostgreSQL. Learning project, work in progress."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Diosvely